WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.950
A rule picks elements with a selector, then sets how they look

2
00:00:04.703 --> 00:00:08.503
A rule starts with a selector. p picks every paragraph.

3
00:00:09.279 --> 00:00:13.679
Inside the braces: a property, a colon, a value, a semicolon.

4
00:00:14.505 --> 00:00:18.630
Both paragraphs turn teal. The heading isn't a P, so it stays.

5
00:00:19.305 --> 00:00:23.880
A dot means a class. Dot note picks only the elements with class note.

6
00:00:24.431 --> 00:00:29.531
Rules pick elements by tag or by class. Everything else stays as it was.
